      "callEndedTimestamp": null,
      "isPinned": false,
      "content": "Hi, i still have a doubt about the clock input. so far, what i understand, that we should provide the clock from outside directly with frequency input what we want, is that right?\n\nI mean, we don't use PLL to get clock from crystal, or something like that.\n\nSo, how normally people feed the clock for their tapeout chip? and what is reasonable frequency to achieve? \n\nThank you.",
      "author": {
